stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: POST /v1/notifications (TX commit + 202)
  pending --> queued: OutboxDispatcher XADD nplat:jobs
  pending --> dead: Admin / fatal error

  queued --> processing: Worker acquires Redis lock + CAS update
  queued --> dead: Permanent failure

  processing --> submitted: Provider returns 2xx + providerMessageId
  processing --> retrying: Transient error / timeout / 429\n(next_attempt_at = now + full_jitter)
  processing --> dead: Permanent error OR attempt_count >= max_attempts\n-> XADD nplat:jobs:dlq

  retrying --> queued: Scheduler polls due rows -> insert outbox_events
  retrying --> dead: Exceeded attempts

  submitted --> delivered: Webhook eventType='delivered'
  submitted --> dead: Webhook eventType='bounced' | 'failed'
